  "ruleText": "Abfd 104.02 Communication with the Committee. Persons wishing to correspond with the committee may do so by using the contact information as outlined in Abfd 104.01.\n\nSource. #7473, eff 4-5-01; ss by #12872, eff 9-20-19",
